1
00:01:36,439 --> 00:01:38,799
Recently, Taiwan, China's Lee Teng-hui,

2
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:40,560
in a talk with a Japanese writer,

3
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,000
made the so-called

4
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,680
"sorrow of being born in Taiwan, China"

5
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,640
and other erroneous remarks,

6
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,480
inciting ethnic division and separatism.

7
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:50,280
These remarks severely distort history

8
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,159
and undermine cross-strait relations.

9
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:54,920
Cross-strait relations face a severe test.

10
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:17,000
Lao Wei,

11
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,039
two things.

12
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,159
Listen to me.

13
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,520
Taipei activated top-level intel assets.

14
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,520
An undercover Comrade in Taiwan, China,

15
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,800
risked their life to send this intel.

16
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:25,800
The second thing:

17
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,520
your old friend might be in danger.

18
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,000
I'm sending you backup right now.

19
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,039
But,

20
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,199
if they don't arrive in time,

21
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:32,639
you're on your own.

22
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:47,639
Starting in March 1992,

23
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,840
ARATS and the Straits Exchange Foundation

24
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:51,039
began talks on relevant issues.

25
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,639
After multiple rounds of talks

26
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:54,159
and exchanging views,

27
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:56,840
they finally agreed that both sides

28
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,400
would orally state, "Both sides of the

29
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,879
Strait uphold the One-China Principle."

30
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,800
In April 1993,

31
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,599
both sides met in Singapore for the

32
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:06,159
globally watched "Wang-Koo Talks."

33
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,400
All sectors had high expectations

34
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,840
for the future of cross-strait relations.

35
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,520
Lee Teng-hui's recent remarks

36
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,479
have sparked different interpretations.

37
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:16,800
There is widespread concern that

38
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,919
the dialogue and mutual trust

39
00:03:18,919 --> 00:03:22,000
built over the years may be severely hit.

40
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,639
The future of cross-strait ties is grim.

41
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,520
Okay, Mr. Zhang.

42
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,960
Hello, Sihai Travel Agency.

43
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,840
I definitely don't have time now.

44
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:06,360
Let's just talk on the phone.

45
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:09,000
The office is leaking.

46
00:04:10,199 --> 00:04:12,680
Or else I'd be calling you from Europe.

47
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,480
Next week won't work.

48
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:21,000
I won't be back for over ten days.

49
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:23,959
Let's keep it simple.

50
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,759
If you lower the rent,

51
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:27,279
I'll renew the lease.

52
00:04:30,079 --> 00:04:31,800
I won't pay a single cent more.

53
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:34,720
Think it over and let me know.

54
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,879
That's it. Bye.

55
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,959
Manager Jiang.

56
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,240
You'd better go check the office.

57
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,800
Is it leaking again?

58
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,560
I told you already.

59
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:45,360
It needs major surgery,

60
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,240
not just a patch.

61
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,639
The same leak keeps coming back.

62
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,480
We must find the source this time.

63
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,000
Did I make myself clear?

64
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,600
It's not a leak.

65
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,959
There's something else inside the wall.

66
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,879
Are you kidding me?

67
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,879
Psycho!

68
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:10,000
Let's split up.

69
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,959
Baoshan, come with me.

70
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,079
To the airport, thank you.

71
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,759
Let's go.

72
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,519
Attention all passengers.

73
00:08:27,279 --> 00:08:29,480
This is Hong Kong, China Int'l Airport.

74
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:30,879
Hello, Miss Jiang.

75
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:32,159
Here is your boarding pass.

76
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,039
Thank you.

77
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:35,720
Passengers taking flight

78
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,039
CX77921, please

79
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:39,440
proceed to the designated gate

80
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,399
to complete boarding.

81
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:44,039
The cabin doors will close shortly.

82
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,039
Thank you for your cooperation.

83
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:47,440
Have a pleasant journey.

84
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,320
Ladies and gentlemen,

85
00:09:34,879 --> 00:09:36,799
I am the chief purser for this flight.

86
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:39,639
Our plane has reached cruising altitude.

87
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,960
The seatbelt sign has been turned off.

88
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:45,039
However, while resting in your seat,

89
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:47,639
please keep your seatbelt fastened.

90
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,679
Let me take a look.

91
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,679
Thank you.

92
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,960
Following the release of the interview,

93
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:01,879
parties on the island debated endlessly.

94
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:04,519
Lee Teng-hui himself has yet to provide

95
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:05,480
further explanation of the remarks.

96
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,000
Scholars point out that

97
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,200
cross-strait ties are at a delicate point,

98
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,759
and any provocative remarks

99
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:12,519
could deepen mutual suspicions

100
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:14,000
or even escalate conflicts,

101
00:10:14,399 --> 00:10:16,080
whose consequences will directly affect

102
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:16,440
peace across the Taiwan Strait.

103
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,399
Time to eat!

104
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,960
Stop working on that.

105
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:20,039
You've planted enough vegetables

106
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:21,399
to last a whole year.

107
00:10:21,639 --> 00:10:22,759
Hurry up! Everyone's waiting for you.

108
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,120
Starting tomorrow,

109
00:10:24,399 --> 00:10:26,440
due to a stronger weather system,

110
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:28,279
the weather will change significantly.

111
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:30,480
Particularly in windward areas,

112
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,919
the impact will be felt more directly.

113
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,039
During the day today,

114
00:10:33,039 --> 00:10:34,000
most areas

115
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:36,639
will be pleasant, partly cloudy to clear,

116
00:10:36,799 --> 00:10:38,320
with the sun occasionally peeking through.

117
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:40,559
Overall, it is quite suitable for

118
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:42,639
outdoor activities or airing out laundry.

119
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,960
However, in the windward eastern regions

120
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:47,120
and southern areas, moisture is higher,

121
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,159
with occasional scattered drizzle,

122
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:50,279
but the impact will be minimal.

123
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:52,600
In addition, please note that

124
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,399
the central and southern plains,

125
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,799
and mountainous areas this afternoon,

126
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,320
may experience thermal effects leading to

127
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,360
localized, brief showers.

128
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,720
Rainfall in mountainous areas

129
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,360
might be slightly heavier.

130
00:11:02,559 --> 00:11:05,679
We recommend bringing light rain gear,

131
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,919
just in case.

132
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,919
Jiang Zaizhen isn't going to Europe.

133
00:11:39,919 --> 00:11:40,840
Where did she go?

134
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,279
What is she doing there?

135
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,639
Reporting to you, sir.

136
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:52,559
There are two main networks.

137
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,720
The first one

138
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,840
is recruiting mainland youth.

139
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,279
Some are recent high school graduates,

140
00:11:58,639 --> 00:12:00,679
some are soldiers in the military,

141
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:01,960
and some

142
00:12:02,279 --> 00:12:04,759
just joined the National Security Bureau.

143
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,240
The second network

144
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:09,279
dispatches our Operatives to the mainland.

145
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,320
Party, government, military, enterprises.

146
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,679
All sectors

147
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:14,679
are covered.

148
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,879
Don't tell me about plans and processes.

149
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,720
I want efficiency.

150
00:12:19,919 --> 00:12:21,080
I want results.

151
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:23,000
I want the mainland's missile plans.

152
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,799
When will we get to see them?

153
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,279
Your current speed

154
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:29,000
is slower than a taxi on Taipei streets.

155
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:30,799
You need to get out there.

156
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,840
Go ask! Go search!

157
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:33,960
Go get it done!

158
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,639
Will intelligence fall from the sky

159
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:37,960
right into your lap if you sit at home?

160
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:41,759
Director.

161
00:12:50,279 --> 00:12:51,720
Are you crazy?

162
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:54,840
Something happened to Jiang Zaizhen.

163
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,919
I've activated the emergency protocol.

164
00:13:24,519 --> 00:13:25,919
Where to?

165
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,480
Take me to Chinatown.

166
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:28,639
It's a bit far.

167
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:29,919
100 bucks.

168
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,759
Let's go. Follow them.

169
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:52,879
The target is here.

170
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,720
We agreed to do this in Hong Kong, China.

171
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,559
How did she end up all the way overseas?

172
00:14:03,879 --> 00:14:05,240
In case something goes wrong,

173
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,559
should we use force?

174
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,120
If you don't explain the plan,

175
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:09,120
we're all left in the dark.

176
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:10,960
I say we grab her first.

177
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,200
She's already made it overseas.

178
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,080
We should secure her right now.

179
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,559
Wait a little longer.

180
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:15,960
Let's see how things play out.

181
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,159
Something's wrong.

182
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:56,919
What do you mean?

183
00:14:57,039 --> 00:14:58,360
Looks like someone else is tailing her.

184
00:14:58,519 --> 00:14:59,559
Probably from the other side.

185
00:14:59,559 --> 00:15:00,279
Should we grab them?

186
00:15:00,279 --> 00:15:01,840
Execute Plan B. Move.

187
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,879
The target has passed.

188
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,360
But their people are still tailing her.

189
00:15:06,519 --> 00:15:07,600
Hold on.

190
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,200
Let's see how this plays out first.

191
00:15:32,519 --> 00:15:33,120
Ah Tao.

192
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,240
A friend from back home came by recently

193
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:41,120
and said your Taoyuan house has an issue.

194
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:41,879
The heavy rain caused a leak

195
00:15:41,879 --> 00:15:43,440
and soaked your parents' bed.

196
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:44,720
What are you talking about?

197
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:45,720
Your parents are in good health.

198
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:47,000
Last time you called Taoyuan,

199
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,080
didn't they mention me?

200
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:48,960
Ah Tao.

201
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:03,360
Get out of the car.

202
00:16:28,159 --> 00:16:28,720
No.

203
00:16:29,039 --> 00:16:30,720
Long time no see, Director Jiang.

204
00:16:33,639 --> 00:16:35,639
I meant to treat you in Hong Kong, China.

205
00:16:35,879 --> 00:16:36,480
I didn't expect...

206
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:38,000
...the evacuation route you arranged for me

207
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,279
...would be put to use so soon.

208
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:40,840
Is it safe here?

209
00:16:41,039 --> 00:16:41,879
If I wasn't sure,

210
00:16:42,159 --> 00:16:43,440
I wouldn't have dared bring you here.

211
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:44,799
Why the sudden evacuation?

212
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:45,960
My car,

213
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:46,799
my home,

214
00:16:46,799 --> 00:16:48,039
my hotel, and my office...

215
00:16:48,039 --> 00:16:49,320
...were all bugged.

216
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:50,679
A week ago,

217
00:16:50,759 --> 00:16:52,679
someone snuck into my bedroom and garage.

218
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:54,000
The CIA or Military Intelligence?

219
00:16:54,279 --> 00:16:55,919
Whoever it was, I couldn't stay.

220
00:16:56,879 --> 00:16:58,720
You have three problems right now.

221
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,320
The mainland's missiles are well hidden.

222
00:17:00,559 --> 00:17:02,080
Military Intel wants to pick the lock.

223
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,120
They're struggling with it.

224
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,799
But rumor has it that recently,

225
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,240
they might make a breakthrough.

226
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,480
Who is the target?

227
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:10,359
When I went to Barcelona with Zhu Yingjia,

228
00:17:10,359 --> 00:17:11,160
and to Hamburg,

229
00:17:11,279 --> 00:17:12,440
the higher-ups didn't say it explicitly.

230
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:13,319
But...

231
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,000
...it was definitely scouting.

232
00:17:15,279 --> 00:17:17,079
Exactly which stump they're watching...

233
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,359
...and which rabbit they're waiting for...

234
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,799
...that's hard to say.

235
00:17:20,359 --> 00:17:21,920
If I hadn't left Hong Kong, China,

236
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,359
I probably would have found out soon.

237
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:25,599
There are too many rabbits.

238
00:17:26,799 --> 00:17:28,680
It'd be best to narrow it down.

239
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,039
In the near future,

240
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:32,119
finding which units with core missile tech

241
00:17:32,119 --> 00:17:35,200
will visit Germany or Spain...

242
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:36,519
...is crucial.

243
00:17:36,799 --> 00:17:37,839
The second thing.

244
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,680
Lee Teng-hui has put a lot of pressure

245
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,880
...on Military Intelligence.

246
00:17:41,319 --> 00:17:42,880
So in the near future,

247
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:45,119
guests visiting the mainland will double.

248
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,440
And the third thing?

249
00:17:46,519 --> 00:17:48,440
Taipei received high-level intelligence

250
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,319
...leading directly to Zheng Guiping.

251
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,680
I saw a part of it.

252
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,200
This proves that...

253
00:17:53,359 --> 00:17:55,279
...the channel to Minzhong National Security

254
00:17:55,759 --> 00:17:56,880
...is clear.

255
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:58,599
Clear.

256
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:00,759
Which means...

257
00:18:01,119 --> 00:18:03,680
someone is heading to report for duty.

258
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:06,000
Some might already be right by your side,

259
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:06,960
and have already started working.

260
00:18:08,759 --> 00:18:10,119
So you should pray hard...

261
00:18:10,519 --> 00:18:12,039
...that the three people in this courtyard

262
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:14,559
...aren't friends from Taiwan, China.

263
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:19,920
If you're hungry, there's food in the car.

264
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,480
First they refill the coffee,

265
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,480
and now they deliver food.

266
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,079
Looks like we're in for a protracted war.

267
00:18:29,359 --> 00:18:30,319
Hard to say.

268
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:32,359
They might kick us out after the meal.

269
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:33,799
Two packs of cigarettes.

270
00:18:33,799 --> 00:18:34,440
Wanna bet?

271
00:18:40,079 --> 00:18:40,960
Four packs.

272
00:18:48,599 --> 00:18:49,680
I didn't expect to find

273
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,000
our hometown seafood braised noodles here.

274
00:18:51,839 --> 00:18:53,559
But the fried garlic isn't authentic.

275
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,839
It'll do.

276
00:18:56,559 --> 00:18:57,839
We can still catch the flight

277
00:18:59,119 --> 00:18:59,920
to Macau, China.

278
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:01,759
There's another flight in three hours.

279
00:19:02,599 --> 00:19:03,240
We'll make it.

280
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:04,640
I have a safe house there.

281
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:05,640
I'll lay low for a few days.

282
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,599
Then we'll decide

283
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:08,119
whether to go to Europe or North America.

284
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:10,559
You left Hong Kong, China unauthorized.

285
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:11,519
