575
00:40:30,719 --> 00:40:31,960
8:00 a.m. on the 27th.

576
00:40:32,159 --> 00:40:33,719
Same place as your interview.

577
00:40:34,119 --> 00:40:34,920
Don't be late.

578
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:35,599
Yes.

579
00:41:06,679 --> 00:41:07,239
Director.

580
00:41:09,519 --> 00:41:11,079
The intel we received has been confirmed.

581
00:41:11,199 --> 00:41:12,480
The detailed situation report

582
00:41:12,719 --> 00:41:13,920
will be sent to the department today.

583
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:15,719
Yes.

584
00:41:15,960 --> 00:41:16,960
Jiang Zaizhen is gone.

585
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:18,280
In Military Intelligence,

586
00:41:18,280 --> 00:41:19,679
our most important contact is lost.

587
00:41:19,920 --> 00:41:21,239
Many of the leads we're following

588
00:41:21,239 --> 00:41:22,480
will have to be re-evaluated.

589
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:24,360
Her contacts must be re-established.

590
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,480
With Jiang Zaizhen compromised,

591
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,079
the other side will definitely tighten up.

592
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:30,360
Their operatives will be more cautious.

593
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,480
We'll have a lot less intel to dig up.

594
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:33,719
In the short term,

595
00:41:33,719 --> 00:41:35,119
we can only tighten our net over here.

596
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,519
We have to try and get more intel

597
00:41:37,519 --> 00:41:38,679
out of their operatives.

598
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:40,159
But this is not a long-term solution.

599
00:41:42,079 --> 00:41:43,239
How to fill this gap,

600
00:41:44,039 --> 00:41:44,920
and who to fill it with...

601
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:46,960
I don't have an answer right now.

602
00:41:47,639 --> 00:41:48,719
Pushing me won't help.

603
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:50,920
I won't make promises I can't keep.

604
00:41:51,599 --> 00:41:52,800
I do have an idea.

605
00:41:53,719 --> 00:41:54,239
It's a little risky.

606
00:41:54,239 --> 00:41:55,239
I haven't fully thought it through,

607
00:41:55,760 --> 00:41:56,840
so I can't share it just yet.

608
00:41:56,840 --> 00:41:57,719
I'll get right on it.

609
00:41:58,440 --> 00:41:59,719
Once the plan is fully formed,

610
00:42:00,079 --> 00:42:01,000
I will report back to you.

611
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:05,599
I know. As soon as possible.

612
00:42:24,719 --> 00:42:26,159
Why was he arrested?

613
00:42:26,719 --> 00:42:28,000
How could he be a spy?

614
00:42:28,199 --> 00:42:29,519
He always seemed so honest.

615
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:31,840
Do spies have 'spy' written on them?

616
00:42:32,599 --> 00:42:33,199
Serves him right.

617
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:34,880
He got what he deserved.

618
00:42:35,079 --> 00:42:36,599
Spies deserve to be shot.

619
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:09,119
I'm Wang Kai,

620
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:10,920
inviting you to watch the TV drama

621
00:43:11,159 --> 00:43:11,880
Crossfire.

622
00:43:12,159 --> 00:43:14,599
Someone's leaking intel to Taiwan, China.

623
00:43:14,599 --> 00:43:15,119
This person

624
00:43:15,119 --> 00:43:16,199
is right here among us.

625
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:17,639
Maybe more than one.

626
00:43:17,639 --> 00:43:18,639
Who do you think it is?

627
00:43:18,760 --> 00:43:19,719
How can we make the missiles

628
00:43:19,719 --> 00:43:21,840
fly faster, higher, and farther?

629
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:24,760
Learn the enemy's strengths to defeat them.

630
00:43:24,920 --> 00:43:26,480
This welcoming gift

631
00:43:26,480 --> 00:43:28,719
can help you solve practical problems.

632
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:30,760
If I refuse your bribes,

633
00:43:31,039 --> 00:43:33,199
how will you coerce me?

634
00:43:33,840 --> 00:43:34,679
Lao Jia!

635
00:43:34,679 --> 00:43:35,280
Lao Jia!

636
00:43:35,280 --> 00:43:36,079
Lao Jia!
